{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","梅瑞特"],["/names/en","Marilee"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名灵巧的射手，当远离敌人时能发挥更大的作用。"],["/description_i18n/en","A deft Marksman who is better positioned farther from enemies."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","啧，是场硬仗啊。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Whew! What a tough fight."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","我好像长高了一点儿！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","I think I grew taller!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","我就在——这儿！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","I'm right over... here!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","总会有这一天的……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","This day... was always... going to come."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","今天的箭格外有准头啊"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","My shots are perfect today!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","哦？有猎物吗？交给我吧。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","What are you hunting? Leave it to me!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","嗯，嗯，怎么，找我有事？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Hm? What's up? Looking for me?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","呃，没猎物呀，呸，再等会儿吧。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","No one's around... hmm..."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","没了人吧？哼。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Time to hunt? Or, do we gotta wait?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇哇哇，我从来没有用过这么精致的东西！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Woah! I've never had anything quite like this!"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","谢谢你的礼物！如果需要我帮忙，就尽管说吧！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Thanks for this! If you ever need a hand, don't hesitate to ask!"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","游林飞矢"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Forest's Arrow"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","合格的猎手会用好每一支箭矢。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","A skilled hunter knows how to make every arrow count."],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","绿林疾风"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Greenwood Gale"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","她是绿林间的猎手，为猎物拉弓，也为正义振弦。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","She's the huntress of the green forest, drawing her bow for both prey and justice."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","参与活动“英雄之影”可得该皮肤。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","From the Shadows"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Elite"],["/skins/1/provenance/localization/RequireDes/languages/en",{"source":"luae_map","source_file":"luae_translation_map_en.csv","pair_order":"26214"}],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","爷爷奶奶应该会喜欢这里"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I'm sure granny and gramps would like it here."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","最近毛皮好像涨价了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","The price of hides has surged lately."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我要带点糖果回去"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I'm bringing some candy back."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这些小灯真漂亮啊！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","These little lights are so pretty!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","该给家人准备礼物了！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","It's time to get gifts ready for my family!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇哦，有好吃的！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Wow, there's something delicious here!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","等下要去大采购！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I'm going on a shopping spree later!"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","梅瑞特的箭术偷师于一些薄暮丛林边境的绿裔，并且凭借着自己的天赋进行了一些合理的改动。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Marilee learned archery from the Wilders on the borders of the Dark Forest in secret. As a gifted archer, she improved her skills on her own."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","梅瑞特在买东西时偶尔会露出看到猎物般势在必得的残酷眼神。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","When she goes shopping, Marilee will sometimes look at an item like a hunter looking at its prey."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","梅瑞特箭囊上的毛皮是她亲手所获的猎物，她每打到个大家伙，就一定会留点战利品在身上。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Marilee's quiver is made from the hide of the creatures she has caught. Whenever she gets a big catch, she'll keep a little piece as a trophy."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","梅瑞特异常擅长讲价，或许是对她来说，商品的底价和猎物的要害是同一回事——而只要是要害，就瞒不过猎人敏锐的目光。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Marilee is an expert at bargaining. To her, the rock-bottom price of a product is like the crucial point of her prey. And a good hunter never misses it."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","梅瑞特很少做所谓的弓术训练，因为每根箭都不能浪费。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Marilee spends little time on archery practice because her arrows are not to be wasted."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","一片随手摘下的叶子，在梅瑞特手中能成为一件简易但有用的乐器——叶哨笛。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Marilee can turn a casually picked leaf into a simple yet practical instrument, the leaf flute."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","“她从盗匪、野兽和魔偶手中保护我们，也把我们从大坑、悬崖和水潭里拉上来。跟她相比，我们才更像无用的人。”——某位冬青学会的学者。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","\"She'd protected us from bandits, wild beasts, and golems. And she'd pulled us out of deep pits, sheer cliffs, and bottomless ponds. We seem so useless compared to her.\" —A Conservatory scholar"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","贩卖猎物时，梅瑞特基本上只收现金，但偶尔也接受以物易物——比如一些弟弟妹妹们没吃过的特殊糖果。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","For the animals that she catches, Marilee accepts cash only. On rare occasions, a trade can be made if it involves special candies her siblings have not yet tried."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","梅瑞特的猎物一直很受山货商人的欢迎，因为她的箭无比准确，猎物宝贵的皮毛常常保持完好。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Because her outstanding skills in archery ensure a perfect piece of hide, her pelts are highly sought after by traders. \"That girl sold me a perfect bear pelt last time. I don't even know how she carried that thing all the way to the market.\" —Bowa"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","梅瑞特上一次落泪是在十四岁生日的深夜，因为她发觉，梦中父母的长相已经开始变得模糊了。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","The last time Marilee cried was on her 14th birthday, because she realized that the image of her parents had started to become blurry in her dreams."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","毛皮……矿石……零件……编织物……唔唔唔唔……"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Fur... minerals... spare parts... braids... Hmm..."],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415015.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415015.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特 & 菲"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Marilee & Fay"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","爷爷奶奶应该会喜欢这里"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","I'm sure granny and gramps would like it here."],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415062.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415062.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Marilee"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","我要带点糖果回去"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","I'm bringing some candy back."],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415063.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415063.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Marilee"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","这些小灯真漂亮啊！"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","These little lights are so pretty!"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415367.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415367.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Marilee"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","该给家人准备礼物了！"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","It's time to get gifts ready for my family!"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415368.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415368.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Marilee"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","哇哦，有好吃的！"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","Wow, there's something delicious here!"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415537.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415537.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Marilee"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","等下要去大采购！"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","I'm going on a shopping spree later!"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415538.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415538.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Marilee"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","准备扎营休息了吗？早知道就给家里捎个信了……"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","Are we camping? I should have notified my family..."],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414040.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414040.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特 & 菲"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Marilee & Fay"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","我啊，一直都想有些弟弟妹妹……"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","I always wanted to have some younger siblings..."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414110.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414110.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","菲 & 梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Fay & Marilee"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","啊，糟糕，箭囊上的毛皮好像被打湿了……"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","Oh, no, the fur on my quiver seems to have gotten wet..."],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414170.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414170.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Marilee & Chippy"]]}